5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QJfyJM3tYMQ7kNvwFDpF8l&_nc_oc=AdqeWfBvZ6UTo6YOF6yhen1Q3641uONHJpuk8lYPS5NYLdeOzrH82SmmCVKhBLOwAss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8HCPLCF6rt74VzCVr1GuGE4fdiU4sK2NzjZ-la2R6bmw&oe=6A393439"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUf0i8ANv_8Q7kNvwEHy8of&_nc_oc=AdqN7hSxgmf_PFwqN9t0sTgmZ-MvuMssKRIuua2BSd0Pi7zF-D33rfOf5RCHaZY9CJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_wmXw-7QQqTNP8-0Pz6Q2d6l2rtTvEx4OeEjuUP4Nk5w&oe=6A394713"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kBtXR_ij4_4Q7kNvwG6VIqF&_nc_oc=AdpsnTncFooePvuyKmC7ldxMEdp6EaS6pcTIqG4qVZc4u-pjiCsR9mcZtnxzsCmrBW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_OWfPsoiWC_yMqwPwlIVUJbzF5tvXDNBgK_lSL0c1bsg&oe=6A39455A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u